1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,990
来咯 营养美味的早餐
There you go. A nice yummy breakfast.

2
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:07,330
咦 那只小妖精上哪儿去了
Hey, where's the little leprechaun?

3
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:09,440
我猜他还在穿衣打扮
Oh, I think he's still getting dressed.

4
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,950
我是说盒子上那只 这不是我们常吃的麦片
No, on the box. This isn't our normal cereal.

5
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:14,280
因为这是商店自营品牌[通常比较便宜]
Well, because this is the store brand,

6
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,360
但还是很好吃
but it's delicious.

7
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:19,720
猜怎么着 有人请我去处理一个案子
Okay, guess what. I just got an offer to handle a case.

8
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:21,600
太好了 我觉得这麦片基本就是木屑
Good, because I think this cereal is mostly sawdust.

9
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,930
非常棒 就是 有点复杂
It is great, it's just there's, um...slight complication.

10
00:00:24,930 --> 00:00:26,600
是给"衣柜衣柜
It's for Closets, Closets...

11
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,760
这走势不妙啊
I don't like where this is going.

12
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:28,930
-"衣柜 -别说了
- Closets... - Don't say it.

13
00:00:28,930 --> 00:00:30,090
"衣柜"公司干活
Closets.

14
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:31,580
不然你以为最后一个词会是什么
What did you think the last word might be?

15
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:33,640
米奇尔 你不能给你父亲的死对头干活呀
Mitchell, you can't work for your father's rival.

16
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:35,830
等等 为什么爷爷会有死对头
Hey, wait. Why does grandpa have a rival?

17
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:37,870
-谁知道 -因为背叛
- Oh, who knows? - Betrayal.

18
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:39,530
因为三十年前
Because 30 years ago,

19
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:41,480
你爷爷的生意伙伴
your grandfather's business partner

20
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:44,460
同时也是最好的朋友 厄尔·钱伯斯
and best friend, Earl Chambers,

21
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:46,210
偷了他装有所有客户名片的名片盒
stole his rolodex with all of his clients

22
00:00:46,210 --> 00:00:47,500
自己开了公司
and started his own company

23
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:50,880
自此那一天被称为"黑色星期三的下午"
on a day that is now known as Black Wednesday Afternoon.

24
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:51,980
根本没这个叫法
Nobody calls it that.

25
00:00:51,990 --> 00:00:53,490
我知道是有一些不愉快的过去
Look, I know that there's some history there,

26
00:00:53,490 --> 00:00:55,130
但我们就不能翻篇吗
but can't we all just move on?

27
00:00:55,130 --> 00:00:56,270
你父亲还没
Your father hasn't.

28
00:00:56,270 --> 00:00:58,550
他每年在这个现称为
He still crank calls Earl every year

29
00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:00,180
"黑色星期三的下午"
on the anniversary of the day

30
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:01,620
还是会给厄尔打骚扰电话
that is now known as Black Wednesday Afternoon.

31
00:01:01,620 --> 00:01:02,970
我真的很需要这份工作
I really need this job.

32
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:05,330
那至少先告诉你爸爸
At least tell your dad first

33
00:01:05,330 --> 00:01:06,810
免得让他承受
and spare him the pain I felt

34
00:01:06,810 --> 00:01:07,830
我发现你还在米格尔店里理发时
when I found out you were still

35
00:01:07,830 --> 00:01:09,000
受到的那种伤害和痛苦
getting your hair cut at Miguel's.

36
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,380
等等 米格尔对你做了什么来着
Wait, what did Miguel do to you again?

37
00:01:10,380 --> 00:01:13,100
他给我推荐了一款给脱发人群用的洗发水 米奇尔
He recommended a shampoo for thinning hair, Mitchell.

38
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:17,810
也许我们可以用这个来固定浴室里松动的瓷砖
Maybe we can use this to fix the loose tile in the bathroom.

39
00:01:31,610 --> 00:01:33,860
邓菲先生 我们能占用你一点时间吗
Hey, Mr. Dunphy, can we have just a moment of your time?

40
00:01:33,860 --> 00:01:37,130
拜托 我们都认识对方多长时间了
Come on, now. How long have we known each other?

41
00:01:37,130 --> 00:01:39,150
我们应该直接用名字称呼对方的
We should be on a first-name basis.

42
00:01:39,150 --> 00:01:41,550
或者直接叫昵称 维他命D
Better yet, a nickname basis, Vitamin D.

43
00:01:41,550 --> 00:01:42,530
听你这么说好开心
Glad to hear you say that,

44
00:01:42,530 --> 00:01:44,840
因为我们需要你帮点忙
'cause, um, we have a favor to ask you.

45
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,360
你知道迪...
You know how Dyl--

46
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:49,440
维他命D在做自己的T恤生意吧
Vitamin D has his own t-shirt business?

47
00:01:49,450 --> 00:01:51,510
我早就该猜到了
Oh, I should've seen this coming.

48
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:54,240
没问题 我愿意当你的模特
Yes, I will model for you,

49
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:55,900
但你要把底片留给我
but I'm gonna need to own the negatives.

50
00:01:55,900 --> 00:01:57,120
太好了
Okay, great.

51
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:59,000
同时 我们还有点希望
Also, we were kind of hoping

52
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,670
能让迪兰跟我在地下室里
that Dylan could stay in the basement

53
00:02:00,670 --> 00:02:02,120
小住一段时间
with me for a little while.

54
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:04,590
他想省下钱来多做一些产品
He's trying to save up to build inventory,

55
00:02:04,590 --> 00:02:06,020
但房租快逼死他了
and rent is killing him.

56
00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:07,740
感觉他们是每六周
It feels like they're asking for money,

57
00:02:07,740 --> 00:02:09,680
跟我要一次钱
like, every six weeks.

58
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,820
我不知道啊
I don't know, guys.

59
00:02:10,830 --> 00:02:13,170
同居可是很重要的决定啊
Moving in together, that's a big step.

60
00:02:13,170 --> 00:02:15,650
只要住一小段时间
It's just for a little while.

61
00:02:15,890 --> 00:02:17,760
求你了
Please?

62
00:02:17,860 --> 00:02:20,690
我想只要你妈妈同意 我就同意
I guess if your mom's okay with it, I'm okay with it.

63
00:02:20,710 --> 00:02:23,310
那你能帮我们问问她吗
Oh, um, and could you ask her for us?

64
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:24,970
我会试看看 但这会是我今天早上
I'll give it a shot, but it'll be the second thing

65
00:02:24,970 --> 00:02:26,240
说服她的第二件事了
I've talked her into this morning,

66
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:30,100
而且她现在完全醒了 大大增加了难度
and it'll be a lot trickier now that she's fully awake.

67
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:32,900
亲爱的 你有时间吗
Hey, hon. Do you have a minute?

68
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:34,400
一小会儿 我今天上班不能迟到
Just. I can't be late to work.

69
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:37,550
我们今天要发布一款新衣柜
We are unveiling a new closet today -- the Trulhatten.

70
00:02:37,550 --> 00:02:39,360
是瑞典产的 便宜 现代
It's Swedish, it's cheap, it's modern.

71
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:41,380
我们要紧握宜家[瑞典品牌]的肉丸[瑞典名吃]
We're gonna grab IKEA by the meatballs.

72
00:02:41,380 --> 00:02:44,380
是这样 我刚刚在跟海莉和迪兰聊
Listen, I was talking to Haley and Dylan --

73
00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:45,800
他们想问问迪兰可不可以
They want to know if he can stay

74
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,720
在地下室住几个星期
in the basement for a few weeks.

75
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:49,800
菲尔 我觉得这样不好啊
Oh, Phil, I think that's a bad idea.

76
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:50,700
他们是成年人了
They're adults,

77
00:02:50,700 --> 00:02:52,980
而且迪兰真的有在努力
and Dylan really has been getting his act together.

78
00:02:52,980 --> 00:02:54,170
这不会烦到你吗
This doesn't bother you?

79
00:02:54,170 --> 00:02:56,240
我不喜欢什么事情都要经过你的同意
I don't enjoy having to get Your approval for everything,

80
00:02:56,240 --> 00:02:58,040
但这是我自己决定的
but that's the deal I made.

81
00:02:58,820 --> 00:03:01,880
海莉和迪兰共处一室
Haley and Dylan in her bedroom.

82
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:03,420
他们自己做出的选择
They're doing what they're doing.

83
00:03:03,420 --> 00:03:05,790
我觉得我们应该开明一点
I say we be evolved about it.

84
00:03:05,790 --> 00:03:06,930
好吧
Fine.

85
00:03:06,950 --> 00:03:09,450
如果你真的能接受我们的宝贝女儿
If you're really okay with our precious daughter

86
00:03:09,450 --> 00:03:12,230
跟她的废柴男友同居
shacking up with her ne'er-do-well boyfriend,

87
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:12,940
那就请便吧
so be it.

88
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:15,840
我就是不想让他们像我们以前那样偷偷摸摸的
I just don't want them sneaking around like we had to.

89
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,890
我这辈子最恐怖的经历
The scariest moment of my life

90
00:03:16,890 --> 00:03:18,230
就是那次我没穿裤子
was that pantsless conversation

91
00:03:18,230 --> 00:03:20,580
隔着那道两截门跟你爸谈话
I had with your dad through the dutch door.

92
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:27,100
你是有多懒啊
How lazy are you?

93
00:03:27,110 --> 00:03:29,470
如果你有事跟我们说 就下楼啊
If you want to talk to us, just come downstairs.

94
00:03:29,470 --> 00:03:32,570
卢克 我上大学了 都不住在那里了
Luke, I'm at college. I don't even live there anymore.

95
00:03:32,570 --> 00:03:34,030
大家都很想你啦
And... you have been missed.

96
00:03:34,030 --> 00:03:36,230
随意啦 我试试打老妈车里的电话
Whatever. I'll try mom in the car.

97
00:03:36,230 --> 00:03:38,250
我真的得跟她说点事情
I really need to talk to her about something.

98
00:03:39,810 --> 00:03:41,130
我听你说呀
I'm here for you.

99
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:42,280
怎么啦
What's wrong?

100
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:44,000
好吧 是桑杰的事情啦
Well, okay. It's Sanjay.

101
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:46,600
我觉得他在躲着我
I feel like he's been avoiding me.

102
00:03:47,870 --> 00:03:49,810
是啊 他真的有在疏远我
I know. He's been really distant.

103
00:03:49,810 --> 00:03:51,210
跟我说看看
Uh, tell me all about it.

104
00:03:51,210 --> 00:03:53,270
别担心 你要说多久说多久
And don't worry. Take all the time you need.

105
00:03:53,270 --> 00:03:56,850
他再也不好好回我短信了
Well he never really texts me back anymore.

106
00:03:57,030 --> 00:03:59,040
也许我应该当面问问他
Maybe I should confront him about it?

107
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:00,510
没错 去吧
Yes! Do it!

108
00:04:00,510 --> 00:04:02,890
是吧 你说得对
Yeah. You know what? You are right.

109
00:04:02,890 --> 00:04:04,910
我现在就给他打电话
I'm totally going to call him right now,

110
00:04:04,910 --> 00:04:06,380
我要告诉他他不能这样对我
And I'm going to tell him he can't treat me this way.

111
00:04:06,380 --> 00:04:06,890
不 不
No, no, no.

112
00:04:06,890 --> 00:04:08,100
不 别这样
No, no, please don't.

113
00:04:08,100 --> 00:04:09,340
好吧 无所谓 我知道了
Fine, whatever. I get it.

114
00:04:09,340 --> 00:04:10,420
我会给他点空间
I'll give him some more space.

115
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:11,570
你现在就可以练习
You could practice right now

116
00:04:11,570 --> 00:04:12,520
稍微往你右边挪一点
and take a scootch to your right.

117
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,380
什么
What?

118
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:14,720
你在跟谁聊天
Who are you talking to?

119
00:04:17,210 --> 00:04:18,800
我弟弟
My brother.

120
00:04:19,170 --> 00:04:19,950
他好可爱
He's cute.

121
00:04:19,950 --> 00:04:21,680
你好 艾丽克斯的弟弟
Hi, Alex's brother.

122
00:04:21,690 --> 00:04:23,540
你好 我是卢克
Hey. I'm Luke.

123
00:04:23,540 --> 00:04:24,810
你是谁
Who are you?

124
00:04:24,810 --> 00:04:25,690
布蕾
Brie.

125
00:04:25,690 --> 00:04:26,830
我住在走廊另一头
I live down the hall.

126
00:04:26,830 --> 00:04:28,790
过来借条裙子 多谢啦 艾丽克斯
Just borrowing a dress. Thanks, Alex.

127
00:04:28,790 --> 00:04:29,570
再见
Mm. Bye.

128
00:04:29,570 --> 00:04:30,160
再见 卢克
Bye, Luke.

129
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:31,990
我有健身的
I-I lift weights!

130
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:34,430
什么事
Hey, what's up?

131
00:04:34,430 --> 00:04:36,780
曼尼 我们现在去大学[能上大学]
Manny, you and I are going to college.

132
00:04:36,780 --> 00:04:37,780
你肯定能上大学的 哥们儿
You sure are, buddy.

133
00:04:37,790 --> 00:04:39,640
谁会理那个辅导员说什么
Who cares what that guidance counselor said?

134
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:41,550
我姐姐的宿舍里有个女孩
Look, there's a girl in my sister's dorm

135
00:04:41,550 --> 00:04:42,780
对我超感兴趣
who's super into me,

136
00:04:42,780 --> 00:04:45,060
她那个超辣的室友就交给你了
and she's got a hot roommate for you.

137
00:04:45,060 --> 00:04:45,930
有多辣
How hot?

138
00:04:45,930 --> 00:04:47,860
尽情地想象吧
Use your imagination.

139
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:49,000
天哪
Holy cow.

140
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,180
我猜她能帮我忘了卡莉
I guess it would help take my mind off of Carly.

141
00:04:51,180 --> 00:04:52,370
我们要不要先约好戴什么颜色的领带
Should we talk about what color ties

142
00:04:52,370 --> 00:04:54,010
免得到时候撞色了
we're gonna wear so we don't clash?

143
00:04:54,010 --> 00:04:55,240
挂了
Click.

144
00:04:55,650 --> 00:04:56,840
曼尼
Manny.

145
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,840
卡莉是谁
So, who is this Carly?

146
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:01,600
卡莉·史蒂文森 她是我的啦啦队员
Carly Stevenson. She's my cheerleader,

147
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,540
不过我觉得她应该不是很开心
But I don't think she's too happy about it.

148
00:05:03,540 --> 00:05:05,300
你说她是你的啦啦队员是什么意思
What do you mean that she's your cheerleader?

149
00:05:05,300 --> 00:05:06,380
橄榄球队的传统
It's a football tradition.

150
00:05:06,380 --> 00:05:08,190
每名队员都搭配一名啦啦队员
They pair each player with a cheerleader,

151
00:05:08,190 --> 00:05:10,010
她们会帮队员装饰储物柜
and then they're supposed to decorate the locker,

152
00:05:10,010 --> 00:05:12,420
烤饼干 留他们喜欢的发型
bake them cookies, wear their hair the way he likes it.

153
00:05:12,420 --> 00:05:14,020
大家都很喜欢
It's fun for everybody.

154
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:16,150
昨天 其他所有队员的储物柜
Yesterday, all the other players' lockers

155
00:05:16,150 --> 00:05:17,550
看起来都跟新奥尔良狂欢节一样
looked like Mardi Gras Floats.

156
00:05:17,550 --> 00:05:19,280
而我的储物柜什么都没有
My locker, nothing.

157
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:20,770
也许你的卡莉太忙了
Maybe your Carly's busy,

158
00:05:20,770 --> 00:05:23,550
不过她肯定会为你做点什么的
but I'm sure she's gonna do something nice for you.

159
00:05:23,780 --> 00:05:26,060
我记得我的啦啦队员 唐娜·德里齐奥
I remember my cheerleader, Donna Deritzio.

160
00:05:26,060 --> 00:05:27,780
她忙得抽不开身 为我做了某些事
She got busy and did something nice for me,

161
00:05:27,780 --> 00:05:30,030
如果你懂我意思的话
if you catch my meaning.

162
00:05:32,530 --> 00:05:33,970
米奇尔 你是第一个来的
Mitchell. You're the first to arrive.

163
00:05:33,970 --> 00:05:35,110
快过来 我给你弄杯饮料
Come on, I'll make you a drink.

164
00:05:35,110 --> 00:05:37,230
不 老爸 我不是来参加派对的
No, Dad. I'm not here for a party.

165
00:05:37,230 --> 00:05:39,280
那就好 我还以为又把谁的生日给忘了
Oh, good. I thought I forgot someone's birthday again.

166
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:41,210
我有话想跟你说说
Listen, there's something I want to talk to you about.

167
00:05:41,210 --> 00:05:43,330
有人请我帮他做事
Um, I got an offer to handle a case,

168
00:05:43,330 --> 00:05:45,440
可我有点担心这名客户的身份
but I'm a little worried about who it's for.

169
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:47,800
有什么问题 关于捕杀鲸鱼吗
What's the matter now? Killing whales?

170
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:49,830
钻油井 还是童工
Drilling for oil? Child labor?

171
00:05:49,830 --> 00:05:50,850
我来告诉你
'cause let me tell you something.

172
00:05:50,850 --> 00:05:52,800
我七岁就去给人送报纸
I had a paper route when I was 7 years old,

173
00:05:52,810 --> 00:05:53,910
你知道我从中得到了什么吗
and you know what it gave me?

174
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:56,570
职业进取心以及如大力水手般的右臂肌肉
A work ethic and a right arm like popeye.

175
00:05:56,580 --> 00:05:57,920
不 老爸 这个...
No, Dad, it --

176
00:05:57,920 --> 00:06:00,280
我要为"衣柜衣柜衣柜...
I'd be working for Closets, Closets, Closets --

177
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:01,550
下一个词最好不是"衣柜"
Next word better not be Closets.

178
00:06:01,550 --> 00:06:02,930
当然是"衣柜"
Of course it's Closets!

179
00:06:02,930 --> 00:06:04,260
我被你弄糊涂了
Now I'm confused.

180
00:06:04,450 --> 00:06:06,600
你说的是"衣柜衣柜衣柜衣柜"公司
Are you talking about Closets, Closets, Closets, Closets,

181
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:07,510
还是"当然是衣柜"公司
or Of Course It's Closets?

182
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:08,990
因为罗伊·卡尔森是个十分正直的人
'cause Roy Carson's a straight shooter,

183
00:06:08,990 --> 00:06:10,370
只是他儿子有点不太正常
and poor guy has a son who's not quite right.

184
00:06:10,370 --> 00:06:12,170
你真的想让我再说一次吗
Are you really making me say this again?

185
00:06:12,170 --> 00:06:13,800
是"衣柜衣柜...
It's Closets, Closets --

186
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,060
你不是要为那个
You're not working for that

187
00:06:15,060 --> 00:06:16,640
偷我客户名片盒的厄尔·钱伯斯工作吧
rolodex-stealing Earl Chambers!

188
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:17,970
一个短期项目 只有几周
It's just short term, a few weeks.

189
00:06:17,970 --> 00:06:18,780
你知道他为什么请你吗
You know why he's doing this?!

190
00:06:18,780 --> 00:06:19,880
因为我是名好律师
Because I'm a good lawyer

191
00:06:19,890 --> 00:06:21,470
而且去年帮你处理过一个相似的案子
who handled a similar case for you last year.

192
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:23,610
他这么做是为了让我不爽
He's doing this to mess with me!

193
00:06:23,610 --> 00:06:25,090
我是被另一名律师推荐过去的
I was referred by another lawyer.

194
00:06:25,090 --> 00:06:26,340
厄尔说不定都不知道是我
I doubt Earl even knows about it.

195
00:06:26,350 --> 00:06:28,710
那个名片盒里全是高级客户
That rolodex was full of A-list clients.

196
00:06:28,710 --> 00:06:31,040
艾瑞克·埃斯特拉达斯 弗兰·塔肯通斯
Your Erik Estradas, your Fran Tarkentons,

197
00:06:31,050 --> 00:06:32,050
莱斯利·乌戈姆斯
your Leslie Uggums.

198
00:06:32,050 --> 00:06:33,190
那些都是真名吗
I'm sorry, are these real names?

199
00:06:33,190 --> 00:06:34,930
记得你上次做的遗嘱认证吗 你是怎么弄砸的
What about that probate? How did you mess that up?

200
00:06:34,930 --> 00:06:36,210
客户都死了
Client's dead.

201
00:06:36,530 --> 00:06:37,940
你有点过分了
Okay, this is crazy.

202
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:39,660
我为什么要关心你的感受
Why am I worried about your feelings

203
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:41,910
反正你根本不在乎我的感受
when you obviously have no concern for mine?

204
00:06:41,910 --> 00:06:44,400
我要接受那份工作
Y-- I'm taking that job.

205
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:45,920
这就像哈特菲尔德家的人去为麦考伊家做事
It's like a Hatfield working for a McCoy.

206
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,680
如果哈特菲尔德家的人真的去为麦考伊家做事
If a Hatfield ever worked for a McCoy.

207
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:50,100
也许就不会再有什么荒唐的家族夙怨了
Maybe it would've ended that ridiculous family feud.

208
00:06:50,100 --> 00:06:51,260
理查德·道森
Richard Dawson!

209
00:06:51,270 --> 00:06:53,810
-他也在名片盒里里 -在名片盒里里
- Also in the rolodex! - Also in the rolodex!

210
00:06:55,760 --> 00:06:58,100
海莉你是不是又拿了我的手机充电器
Hailey did you take my phone chargne again?

211
00:06:58,100 --> 00:06:59,150
什么
What?

212
00:07:01,150 --> 00:07:03,140
我的充电器是不是在你那
Do you have my charger?!

213
00:07:03,140 --> 00:07:04,780
我听不见 发短信给我
I can't hear you. Just text me.

214
00:07:04,780 --> 00:07:06,230
我还想呢
I wish I could!

215
00:07:06,230 --> 00:07:08,800
亲爱的 你得自己买个充电器了
I really need you to get your own charger, honey.

216
00:07:08,810 --> 00:07:10,470
你们都在床上啊
Oh, you're both in the bed together.

217
00:07:10,470 --> 00:07:12,150
爸爸 没关系
Dad, it's fine.

218
00:07:12,150 --> 00:07:14,400
我们的房间就是你的房间 菲侠盗
Our room is your room, Philibuster.

219
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:15,670
谢谢 迪兰
Thank you, Dylan.

220
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:19,420
我只是 在找我的充电器
Uh, anyway, just, uh, looking for my charger.

221
00:07:19,650 --> 00:07:21,100
抱歉 老爸 不在这里
Sorry, Dad, it's not here.

222
00:07:21,100 --> 00:07:24,140
看来我要习惯没有电的日子了
Guess I'll just get used to not having any power.

223
00:07:27,570 --> 00:07:28,680
卡莉
Carly?

224
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,700
卡莉
Carly?

225
00:07:32,660 --> 00:07:34,080
-卡莉 -什么事
- Carly? - Yeah?

226
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:35,680
-就知道是你 -你是谁
- I thought so. - Who are you?

227
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:36,790
我是曼尼的妈妈
I am Manny's mother,

228
00:07:36,790 --> 00:07:37,810
我想知道你为什么
and I want to know why

229
00:07:37,810 --> 00:07:40,320
没有好好装饰他的储物柜
you haven't done a better job at decorating his locker.

230
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:42,450
因为这是个愚蠢的带有性别歧视的传统
Because it's a stupid sexist tradition.

231
00:07:42,450 --> 00:07:44,170
为什么不是球员来装饰我们的储物柜
Why don't the players decorate our lockers?

232
00:07:44,170 --> 00:07:46,490
你应该在当上啦啦队员前
That's a very good question you should have asked yourself

233
00:07:46,500 --> 00:07:48,490
问自己这个问题
before becoming a cheerleader.

234
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:49,950
给
Here.

235
00:07:50,150 --> 00:07:51,820
买点好看的东西
Buy yourself something pretty

236
00:07:51,820 --> 00:07:53,970
去装饰我儿子的储物柜
and put it on my son's locker.

237
00:07:53,970 --> 00:07:55,230
迪尔加多·普里契特太太
Mrs. Delgado-Pritchett,

238
00:07:55,230 --> 00:07:57,510
能来一下我的办公室吗
May I please see you in my office?

239
00:07:57,630 --> 00:07:59,570
我要求给曼尼换一个新的啦啦队员
Okay, I want a new cheerleader for Manny.

240
00:07:59,570 --> 00:08:01,030
把年级名册拿出来 我帮他挑一个
Give me this yearbook and I'm gonna pick one for him.

241
00:08:01,030 --> 00:08:02,830
不行 即便我认为那是个好主意
No. Even if I did think that was a good idea,

242
00:08:02,830 --> 00:08:05,840
我也不能滥用我在学校里的职权
I'm not gonna abuse my position of power in the school.

243
00:08:05,840 --> 00:08:07,940
你的办公室就是个杂物房
You share an office with a tetherball.

244
00:08:07,950 --> 00:08:09,750
你还是让他顺应自然成长吧
You have to just let nature take its course,

245
00:08:09,750 --> 00:08:12,730
就像我最近在网络直播上看到的那样
just like this webcam I've been watching.

246
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:15,430
现在在直播一群野生水獭
It's a live stream of wild otters.

247
00:08:15,430 --> 00:08:17,720
我记不清了 它是形容矮个多毛的人
I forget, is it the small hairy men

248
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,220
还是形容高个没毛的人
or the tall not hairy men?

249
00:08:19,220 --> 00:08:22,540
矮个多毛的 不过这些是真的水獭 你看
Small hairy, but these are actual otters. Look.

250
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:25,650
这个水獭妈妈刚刚产下双胞胎幼崽
See, this mama otter just gave birth to twins.

251
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:27,400
这个小一点的 它比较虚弱
Now, the little one, he's struggling,

252
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:29,850
但你有看到它妈妈对它溺爱了吗
but do you see the mama doting on him?

253
00:08:29,860 --> 00:08:31,080
不 并没有
No, you do not.

254
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:33,520
要我说 它是个不称职的母亲
Well, if you ask me, she's being a terrible mother.

255
00:08:33,530 --> 00:08:35,970
她应该用自信和鱼来填饱他的肚子
She should be filling him with confidence

256
00:08:35,970 --> 00:08:37,830
就像我对曼尼做的那样
and fish like I do to Manny.

257
00:08:37,830 --> 00:08:41,280
高中生活充满困难 这是人生经历的一部分
High school is difficult. It's part of the experience.

258
00:08:41,290 --> 00:08:43,220
而那不是件坏事
And that's not a bad thing.

259
00:08:43,230 --> 00:08:45,050
学习该如何应对沮丧
Learning how to handle disappointment

260
00:08:45,050 --> 00:08:46,750
坚强地战胜困难
and overcoming adversity,

261
00:08:46,750 --> 00:08:50,210
也正是我能成为今天这样的一部分原因
that's part of the reason I am where I am today.

262
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:54,560
查克 不行 这里已经没有空地了
Chuck, no. No, no, no. There's no more room in here.

263
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,550
我求你了 拜托
I beg you, please!

264
00:08:57,890 --> 00:08:59,170
会议室在那边
Conference room is down there.

265
00:08:59,170 --> 00:08:59,880
很不错
Oh, very nice.

266
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,910
这里是钱伯斯先生的办公室
This is Mr. Chambers' office.

267
00:09:01,910 --> 00:09:03,800
他正好在 让我给你们介绍一下
Oh, he's in. Let me introduce you.

268
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:05,120
厄尔 能打扰一下吗
Earl, am I bothering you?

269
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:08,040
什么事也打扰不了我 我要上《时代》周刊了
Nothing's bothering me. I'm gonna be in Time magazine.

270
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:09,460
-《衣柜时代》周刊 -闭嘴
- Closet Time. - Shut up.

271
00:09:09,460 --> 00:09:11,570
-这位是律师... -好吧
- This is the attorney... - Okay. All right, all right.

272
00:09:11,570 --> 00:09:13,090
处理福勒案子的 米奇尔...
handling the Fowler case, Mitchell...

273
00:09:13,090 --> 00:09:14,640
-叫我米奇尔就行 -普里契特
- Just call me Mitchell. - Pritchett.

274
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:16,030
普里契特
Pritchett?

275
00:09:16,030 --> 00:09:17,540
米奇·普里契特
Mitch Pritchett.

276
00:09:17,540 --> 00:09:19,440
那个狗杂种杰·普里契特的儿子吗
Son of that son of a bitch Jay Pritchett?

277
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,260
正是在下
Reporting for duty.

278
00:09:20,260 --> 00:09:23,360
公文包也别打开了
Don't bother unpacking that briefcase.

279
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:25,550
我是不会容许普里契特家的人在我这工作
I cannot have a Pritchett hanging around here.

280
00:09:25,550 --> 00:09:27,970
我这里有太多敏感信息
I got too much sensitive information

281
00:09:27,970 --> 00:09:30,490
都是你老爸想要得到的
your dad would love to get his hands on.

282
00:09:30,490 --> 00:09:31,630
那只是个自取外卖菜单
That was a takeout menu.

283
00:09:31,630 --> 00:09:34,260
我不想让他知道我在哪吃饭
I don't want that man to know where I eat.

284
00:09:34,370 --> 00:09:35,590
我来这里只是为了工作
I'm just here to do a job.

285
00:09:35,590 --> 00:09:36,590
我不在乎三十年前
I don't care what happened

286
00:09:36,590 --> 00:09:38,620
你和我爸之间发生了什么事
between you and my dad 30 years ago.

287
00:09:38,620 --> 00:09:41,080
已经过了那么长时间了吗
Has it really been that long?

288
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:43,490
发生这件事的时候我还很小
I was little when the whole thing started.

289
00:09:43,490 --> 00:09:44,890
我以前总叫您厄尔叔叔
I used to call you Uncle Earl.

290
00:09:44,890 --> 00:09:47,750
我还记得 你是个可爱的孩子
I remember that. You were a cute kid.

291
00:09:47,750 --> 00:09:50,770
那个魔方你拼好了吗
Hey, did you ever solve that Rubik's cube?

292
00:09:50,770 --> 00:09:52,040
我拼好了三面
I got three sides.

293
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:53,460
还不赖
Not bad.

294
00:09:54,410 --> 00:09:56,660
管他呢 你可以留下来了
What the hell? You can stay.

295
00:09:56,670 --> 00:09:58,710
也许你在这里工作
Maybe you working here can be the beginning

296
00:09:58,710 --> 00:10:02,430
可以开启我们两家关系的新篇章
of a new chapter between our two families.

297
00:10:02,510 --> 00:10:05,070
这么跟你说吧 你跟你爸说
I'll tell you what, you tell your dad

298
00:10:05,350 --> 00:10:07,870
如果他想握手言和 我请他吃饭
if he wants to bury the hatchet, dinner's on me.

299
00:10:07,870 --> 00:10:08,890
真的吗
Oh, really?

300
00:10:08,890 --> 00:10:10,580
那是当然
Absolutely.

301
00:10:12,860 --> 00:10:15,420
真希望我爸能像你一样通情达理
I just wish my dad was as reasonable as you.

302
00:10:15,420 --> 00:10:17,210
谢谢夸奖 快出去吧
Thank you very much. Now get out of here.

303
00:10:17,210 --> 00:10:19,140
我还要拍封面呢
I got to get my cover shot.

304
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:21,600
-您的照片不会上封面 -闭嘴
- You're not on the cover. - Shut up!

305
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,860
你们俩来这干什么
What are you two doing here?

306
00:10:24,860 --> 00:10:26,790
向处于困境的家人施以援手
Reaching out to a family member in distress.

307
00:10:26,790 --> 00:10:28,460
昨天你在视频里非常沮丧
You sounded pretty upset yesterday.

308
00:10:28,460 --> 00:10:30,260
所以你们就大老远地开车过来了吗
So, you drove all the way down here?

309
00:10:30,270 --> 00:10:31,230
太感人了
That's so sweet.

310
00:10:31,230 --> 00:10:32,790
我们来陪你了
Hey, we're here for you.

311
00:10:32,790 --> 00:10:34,750
你感觉怎么样 有什么新情况吗
How are you feeling? What's new?

312
00:10:34,750 --> 00:10:36,280
你朋友布蕾的房间在哪
Where's your friend Brie's room?

313
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:38,120
下楼左拐 赶紧滚
Down the hall to the left. Just go.

314
00:10:38,310 --> 00:10:39,480
你有蒸汽熨斗吗
Do you have a steam iron?

315
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:41,720
因为我希望这西装...
Because I would love to give this blazer a --

316
00:10:43,030 --> 00:10:44,040
宝贝
Hi, honey.

317
00:10:44,420 --> 00:10:47,020
抱歉回来晚了 今天简直忙疯了
Sorry I'm so late. Work was so crazy today.

318
00:10:47,020 --> 00:10:48,040
从我一进公司开始
From the moment I got there,

319
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:50,220
问题就层出不穷
it was just one problem after another.

320
00:10:50,220 --> 00:10:51,450
但那都是衣柜的问题 是吧
But all just closet stuff, right?

321
00:10:51,450 --> 00:10:52,140
是啊
Yeah.

322
00:10:52,140 --> 00:10:55,560
迪兰的事我想向你道歉
Listen, I want to apologize about the whole Dylan thing.

323
00:10:56,220 --> 00:10:58,890
我没有考虑你的处境
I wasn't taking your feelings into consideration.

324
00:10:58,950 --> 00:11:00,280
我知道你看到他睡在海莉房间里
I know how uncomfortable you are

325
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:02,820
非常不舒服 所以...
with him sleeping in Haley's room, so...

326
00:11:03,260 --> 00:11:05,090
我认为我们应该重新考虑一下
I think we should reconsider.

327
00:11:05,350 --> 00:11:06,480
真的吗
Really?

328
00:11:07,300 --> 00:11:08,570
看着我
Look at me.

329
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:10,580
这不仅是我家 也是你家
This is as much your house as it is mine.

330
00:11:10,580 --> 00:11:11,770
我知道
I know that.

331
00:11:11,770 --> 00:11:13,030
我们一起去赶走他
Let's go kick him out.

332
00:11:15,580 --> 00:11:18,180
两位 能谈一下吗
Hey, guys. Can we talk for a second?

333
00:11:18,180 --> 00:11:19,710
-什么事 -还是坐下说吧
- What's up? - Actually, let's sit down.

334
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:22,560
我们要讨论一件非常重要的事
There's something pretty important we need to discuss.

335
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,760
好吧
Okay, whoa.

336
00:11:23,760 --> 00:11:25,590
当我发现我父亲其实
This is exactly how it started out

337
00:11:25,590 --> 00:11:29,050
并不在太空里时就是这样的情境
when I found out my father wasn't really in space.

338
00:11:30,560 --> 00:11:35,250
经过很周密的考虑
Anyway, um, after some careful consideration...

339
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,190
你母亲和我有话要说
your mother has something to say.

340
00:11:37,190 --> 00:11:38,360
克莱尔 你说吧
Claire, you're up.

341
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,640
就在那一瞬间 我突然意识到
That was the moment I realized

342
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:41,550
是菲尔想让我把迪兰赶走
Phil wanted me to kick Dylan out

343
00:11:41,550 --> 00:11:43,380
这样他就能做个很酷的父亲
so he could be the cool one.

344
00:11:43,380 --> 00:11:44,790
我也可以很酷
Well, I can be cool, too.

345
00:11:44,790 --> 00:11:47,350
我比酷更酷[冷] 我是严寒
I'm cooler than cool. I'm frigid.

346
00:11:47,350 --> 00:11:48,560
妈妈 什么事
Mom, what is it?

347
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:52,820
我们想晚上吃披萨
We were thinking about having pizza for dinner.

348
00:11:53,780 --> 00:11:54,700
克莱尔
Claire.

349
00:11:54,700 --> 00:11:56,000
我知道前几天已经吃过了
I know we had it a couple of days ago,

350
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,910
不过我太累了不想做饭
but I'm too tired to cook.

351
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:58,790
我要去换衣服了
I'm gonna go change my clothes.

352
00:11:58,790 --> 00:12:01,690
克莱尔 宝贝
Claire, um...honey.

353
00:12:02,570 --> 00:12:03,900
好奇怪
That was weird.

354
00:12:03,950 --> 00:12:05,180
你知道什么才叫奇怪吗
You know what's weird?

355
00:12:05,180 --> 00:12:06,610
本以为你爸在月球上
Thinking your dad's on the moon,

356
00:12:06,610 --> 00:12:08,790
结果却看见他在商城工作
then seeing him working at the mall.

357
00:12:10,130 --> 00:12:11,080
克莱尔 刚才怎么回事
Claire, what was that?

358
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,730
我以为我们要赶迪兰走的
I thought we were giving Dylan the boot.

359
00:12:12,730 --> 00:12:15,020
是 但是我突然发现
Yeah, but then I suddenly realized

360
00:12:15,020 --> 00:12:16,790
我有点霸道了
I'm being so unfair.

361
00:12:16,790 --> 00:12:18,740
你乐意迪兰住在这里
You like having Dylan here.

362
00:12:18,740 --> 00:12:19,550
没错 但是
Yeah, but --

363
00:12:19,550 --> 00:12:21,180
亲爱的 看着我
Honey, look at me.

364
00:12:21,180 --> 00:12:24,020
这不仅是我家 也是你家
This is as much your house as mine.

365
00:12:24,020 --> 00:12:25,290
是吗
It is?

366
00:12:25,700 --> 00:12:26,920
赶紧去叫披萨吧
Now go order the pizza.

367
00:12:26,920 --> 00:12:29,730
天黑了 他们俩差不多要上床睡觉了
It's getting late and those two are heading off to bed soon.

368
00:12:33,060 --> 00:12:34,890
米奇尔 你走运了
Oh, hey, Mitchell, you're in luck.

369
00:12:34,890 --> 00:12:37,100
我背上还有地方可以插刀呢
There's room for another knife in my back.

370
00:12:37,110 --> 00:12:39,030
我来这是想当面告诉你
I just came here to tell you to your face

371
00:12:39,030 --> 00:12:40,100
你错怪厄尔了
that you're wrong about Earl.

372
00:12:40,100 --> 00:12:41,420
他这人没这么坏
He is not that bad a guy.

373
00:12:41,420 --> 00:12:42,950
我见过他吃熊猫肉排
I've seen him eat a panda steak.

374
00:12:42,950 --> 00:12:44,400
他是有他的问题
He is a little rough around the edges,

375
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:47,300
但是他不想再跟你斗下去了
but, look, he wants the rivalry to end.

376
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:48,240
想都别想
Never!

377
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,780
问题不在他
You know, he's not the problem.

378
00:12:49,780 --> 00:12:51,690
在你 是你有问题
You are. You.

379
00:12:51,690 --> 00:12:53,220
心胸过于狭隘
So blinded by pettiness.

380
00:12:53,220 --> 00:12:55,460
别人主动握手言和 你都无动于衷
You can't even see when a man's extending an olive branch,

381
00:12:55,460 --> 00:12:57,020
-反而还 我的天 -怎么了
- and -- oh, my god. - What?

382
00:12:57,020 --> 00:12:59,650
我只是突然意识到任何事情都有两面
I just realized there are two sides to every story,

383
00:12:59,650 --> 00:13:01,490
我又有什么资格批评你呢
and who am I to discount yours?

384
00:13:01,490 --> 00:13:04,120
我们还是进屋吧 然后
We should go inside and we should --

385
00:13:09,570 --> 00:13:10,150
你刚才想说什么
You were saying?

386
00:13:10,150 --> 00:13:12,740
没什么 我再也不说话了
Nothing. I'm never saying anything ever again.

387
00:13:20,210 --> 00:13:21,020
歌洛莉亚
Gloria?

388
00:13:21,020 --> 00:13:21,840
我不是
No.

389
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,120
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

390
00:13:23,750 --> 00:13:24,650
是我
Yes.

391
00:13:24,650 --> 00:13:27,440
彩色纸带 彩灯
Streamers, twinkle lights.

392
00:13:28,130 --> 00:13:29,270
"性感曼尼"
"Sexy Manny"?

393
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:31,770
我希望这里有个好医生的电话号码
I hope there's a number to a good therapist in here.

394
00:13:31,770 --> 00:13:33,560
我可没时间跟你扯这个
I don't have time for this.

395
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:36,630
这是什么
What is this?

396
00:13:36,630 --> 00:13:37,700
我怎么说来着
Well, well, well.

397
00:13:37,700 --> 00:13:38,630
你看看这个
Would you look at that?

398
00:13:38,630 --> 00:13:41,080
我说要顺其自然 你猜怎么着
I said to leave things alone, and what do you know?

399
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:43,590
啦啦队员想通了 你是不是该承认错了
The cheerleader came through, so apology accepted.

400
00:13:43,590 --> 00:13:44,870
你瞎说什么呢
What are you talking about?

401
00:13:44,870 --> 00:13:46,460
她这么做是因为老娘震住她了
She did this because I scared her.

402
00:13:46,470 --> 00:13:48,190
好吧 不管是我们对了还是你错了
Well, whether we were both right or just me,

403
00:13:48,190 --> 00:13:50,310
关键都在于船到桥头自然直
the point is things worked themselves out,

404
00:13:50,310 --> 00:13:52,910
所以我觉得我们可以回家了
so I think we can go home.

405
00:13:54,430 --> 00:13:55,970
卡莉 你好
Carly, hello.

406
00:13:55,970 --> 00:13:57,480
太感谢你了
Thank you so much

407
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,920
把曼尼的储物柜装饰得这么漂亮
for doing such a great job on Manny's locker.

408
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:00,140
我还没把装饰弄上去呢
I haven't decorated it yet.

409
00:14:00,140 --> 00:14:01,470
什么 那是谁
What? But then who would --

410
00:14:01,470 --> 00:14:04,240
我猜我们会一直傻傻分不清楚 所以就
Well, I guess we'll never know, so...

411
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:05,460
卡梅隆
Cameron.

412
00:14:06,190 --> 00:14:07,680
好吧 是我做的
Okay, fine, I did it.

413
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:10,340
说好的要让母性的本能散发光辉呢
What happened with letting mother nature take its course

414
00:14:10,340 --> 00:14:12,660
就像你电脑里那些水獭那样
like the otters in your computer?

415
00:14:12,680 --> 00:14:14,300
-小的那只死掉了 -什么
- The little one's dead. - What?

416
00:14:14,300 --> 00:14:15,840
那只母水獭袖手旁观
The mother, she did nothing

417
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:16,300
任由老鹰把小水獭啄烂了
while an eagle pecked it apart.

418
00:14:16,310 --> 00:14:17,920
大自然太残忍了
Nature is cruel.

419
00:14:18,010 --> 00:14:19,310
你帮曼尼装饰了储物柜
You decorated Manny's locker?

420
00:14:19,310 --> 00:14:20,600
我装饰了八个人的
I decorated eight of them.

421
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:22,470
这传统已经濒临废灭了
This tradition's on fumes.

422
00:14:24,460 --> 00:14:25,130
好了
All right.

423
00:14:25,130 --> 00:14:26,610
这就是了吧
So, this is it, huh?

424
00:14:27,350 --> 00:14:29,000
贼鼠的老巢
The rat's nest.

425
00:14:29,620 --> 00:14:32,700
哎哟喂 你好啊 杰克·罗德
Well, well, well, aloha, Jack Lord.

426
00:14:32,700 --> 00:14:35,070
我的名片盒里还有你的名片呢
I remember you from my rolodex.

427
00:14:35,250 --> 00:14:37,600
太糗了 我居然被你拉进坑里了
I'm so embarrassed. I can't believe I fell for it.

428
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:38,950
最起码你最后明白了
Well, at least you finally realized

429
00:14:38,950 --> 00:14:40,420
这不只是什么简单的竞争
this is not some silly rivalry.

430
00:14:40,420 --> 00:14:43,420
让我把他的雪茄找出来 在我二弟上摩擦摩擦
Now let me get at his cigars so I can drag my deal across it.

431
00:14:43,420 --> 00:14:44,520
好吧 我得说
Okay, I have to say,

432
00:14:44,520 --> 00:14:45,910
威士忌的劲儿过去了
the scotch is starting to wear off

433
00:14:45,910 --> 00:14:47,910
我重新考虑了下这个计划 老爸
and I'm having second thoughts about this plan, Dad.

434
00:14:47,910 --> 00:14:48,880
还有什么好考虑的
What's there to think about?

435
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:49,530
你给我照张
You take a picture of me

436
00:14:49,530 --> 00:14:51,300
我用二弟摩擦这些雪茄的照片
dragging my deal across the cigars,

437
00:14:51,310 --> 00:14:52,960
等他把它们都抽完
we give him enough time to smoke them,

438
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,270
然后再把照片发给厄尔
and we send the photo to Earl.

439
00:14:54,270 --> 00:14:56,090
首先 这样一来厄尔手上就会有一张
First of all, Earl will then have a picture of you

440
00:14:56,090 --> 00:14:57,080
你脱了裤子的照片
with your pants down,

441
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,890
而我也会记住这个可怕的画面
and I'll have that same picture

442
00:14:58,890 --> 00:15:00,680
萦绕脑中 余生难忘
in my brain for the rest of my life.

443
00:15:00,680 --> 00:15:03,130
你怎么就突然开始嫌弃看别人的二弟呢
Suddenly you're squeamish about seeing another man's deal?

444
00:15:03,130 --> 00:15:05,000
那个家伙耍了你 米奇尔
The man made a fool of you, Mitchell!

445
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:06,260
你说得对 我想太多了
You're right. I'm overthinking it.

446
00:15:06,270 --> 00:15:07,500
放它出来吧
Whip it out.

447
00:15:07,580 --> 00:15:09,430
让你二弟乖乖待在裤子里 普里契特
Keep your deal in your pants, Pritchett!

448
00:15:09,430 --> 00:15:11,170
所有人都管那叫二弟吗
Okay, does everybody call it a deal?

449
00:15:11,170 --> 00:15:12,570
怎么我从来没听说
How have I never heard of this?

450
00:15:12,570 --> 00:15:14,480
厄尔 你这次太过分了
You've gone too far this time, Earl.

451
00:15:14,500 --> 00:15:15,760
把我的家人都扯进来了
Bringing my family into this.

452
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:17,730
就是 你怎么能这样 我那么信任你
Yeah. How could you? I trusted you.

453
00:15:17,740 --> 00:15:19,560
我在我爸面前替你辩护
I defended you to my father,

454
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:21,660
你却把我当傻子耍
and you made me look like a fool!

455
00:15:22,030 --> 00:15:25,120
而这都是为了什么呢 衣柜吗
And all for what? Closets.

456
00:15:25,210 --> 00:15:27,180
你在讽刺那个让所有人开始新的一天时
You mean the place that people start each day,

457
00:15:27,180 --> 00:15:28,600
都能从里面选出一身带来自信的靓装
choosing an outfit that gives them

458
00:15:28,610 --> 00:15:30,160
让他们能追求梦想的那个地方吗
the confidence to achieve their dreams?

459
00:15:30,160 --> 00:15:33,110
还是说那个能让奖金室摇身一变卧室
Or that magical space that turns a bonus room

460
00:15:33,110 --> 00:15:35,590
让房子成为家的那一方神奇天地
into a bedroom and a house into a home?

461
00:15:35,590 --> 00:15:37,080
全赖你用了廉价的材料
Thanks to cheap materials,

462
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:39,310
你卖的衣柜把房子都变成火险区了
your closets turn a house into a fire trap!

463
00:15:39,310 --> 00:15:40,730
对于那事我们选择不上诉
We pleaded no contest.

464
00:15:40,730 --> 00:15:42,380
但是我们没承认有罪
That is not an admission of guilt.

465
00:15:42,390 --> 00:15:43,500
你逼我的 我要把二弟喊出来
I'm doing it. I'm taking my deal out.

466
00:15:43,500 --> 00:15:46,500
你想得美 起来 起来
The hell you are! Get up! Get up!

467
00:15:48,660 --> 00:15:50,920
我要像碾蛋壳一样把你的头碾碎
I'll crush your skull like an egg!

468
00:15:54,100 --> 00:15:55,440
他们还说本学期结束前
And they say by the end of the semester,

469
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:56,950
我们就能做基因组测序了
we'll know how to sequence a genome.

470
00:15:56,950 --> 00:15:59,000
我不太懂基因组
I don't know about genomes,

471
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:01,420
不过在我爸他们家那边
but on my father's side of the family,

472
00:16:01,420 --> 00:16:03,190
倒是有个花园地精[音同基因]
we do have a garden gnome.

473
00:16:03,190 --> 00:16:05,550
他拿蘑菇当伞撑
He uses a mushroom as an umbrella.

474
00:16:07,550 --> 00:16:08,860
曼尼 该你说了
Manny, you're up.

475
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:10,780
请允许我承认
Can I just say it's so amazing

476
00:16:10,780 --> 00:16:12,650
能和你们两位待在一起真是太棒了
spending some time with you two.

477
00:16:12,650 --> 00:16:15,230
我真是烦透了肤浅的
I am so sick of superficial,

478
00:16:15,230 --> 00:16:17,370
以自我为宇宙中心的高中女孩
self-absorbed high-school girls.

479
00:16:17,370 --> 00:16:19,760
天啊 我超讨厌高中女孩
Oh, my god, I hated high-school girls.

480
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:21,090
啦啦队员是她们中最糟的
The worst are cheerleaders.

481
00:16:21,090 --> 00:16:23,690
她们以前经常嘲笑我的脊柱矫正背带
They used to make fun of me behind my back brace.

482
00:16:23,690 --> 00:16:26,720
准"背"好听听这句话吧
Well, brace yourself for this.

483
00:16:26,720 --> 00:16:28,380
你现在很性感
You look hot now.

484
00:16:29,920 --> 00:16:31,190
曼尼 还是你上吧
Manny, you're up.

485
00:16:31,190 --> 00:16:32,410
请原谅我的朋友
Forgive my friend.

486
00:16:32,410 --> 00:16:34,430
你们两个实在太美了
It's just that you two are so beautiful,

487
00:16:34,430 --> 00:16:36,300
有点让我们不知所措
it's a little intimidating.

488
00:16:38,730 --> 00:16:39,750
好吧
Okay.

489
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:41,420
大学并不像我们预想得那样
College isn't going the way we thought.

490
00:16:41,430 --> 00:16:43,340
自从来到这里 我们都还没亲过男生
Neither of us has kissed a guy since we got here.

491
00:16:43,340 --> 00:16:44,380
所以...
So...

492
00:16:45,580 --> 00:16:46,480
你是指我们吗
You mean us?

493
00:16:46,490 --> 00:16:47,950
-是的 -现在吗
- Yeah. - Now?

494
00:16:47,950 --> 00:16:49,690
根据校园规定
In accordance with campus regulations,

495
00:16:49,690 --> 00:16:51,100
你们已经获得我们的许可了
you have our consent.

496
00:16:51,100 --> 00:16:52,490
好棒
Yes!

497
00:16:52,490 --> 00:16:54,500
谢谢 我马上回来
Thank you. I'll be right back.

498
00:16:57,280 --> 00:17:00,010
口香糖 口香糖 我需要口香糖
Gum, gum, gum. I need gum.

499
00:17:00,100 --> 00:17:01,510
我没有
I don't have any.

500
00:17:07,660 --> 00:17:08,770
谢谢
Thanks.

501
00:17:09,020 --> 00:17:11,150
我终于联系上桑杰了
I finally got through to Sanjay.

502
00:17:15,320 --> 00:17:16,670
这是隐私吧
Sounds personal.

503
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:18,360
我可不想打探你的隐...
I don't want to stick my nose into your --

504
00:17:18,360 --> 00:17:19,940
他跟我分手了
He broke up with me.

505
00:17:21,570 --> 00:17:23,270
他跟别人好上了
He's seeing someone else.

506
00:17:23,350 --> 00:17:27,160
你现在应该很想一个人待着吧
Um, you probably want to be alone right now.

507
00:17:28,570 --> 00:17:30,180
我已经成一个人了
I am alone.

508
00:17:35,290 --> 00:17:36,410
别这样
Come on.

509
00:17:36,410 --> 00:17:38,080
你会好起来的
You'll be okay.

510
00:17:40,070 --> 00:17:41,360
那...
That's, uh...

511
00:17:42,190 --> 00:17:44,090
我也只会用这句安慰人了
That's really all I got.

512
00:17:45,020 --> 00:17:45,740
卢克 快点
Luke, hurry up.

513
00:17:45,740 --> 00:17:47,310
她们快要恢复理智了
They're starting to come to their senses.

514
00:17:47,310 --> 00:17:49,570
去吧 我没事
Go. It's fine.

515
00:17:54,710 --> 00:17:56,750
我还是留下来陪着艾丽克斯吧
I'm gonna stay with Alex.

516
00:17:56,750 --> 00:17:58,470
有什么我能做的吗
Is there anything I can do?

517
00:17:59,270 --> 00:18:00,390
我觉得没有
I don't think so.

518
00:18:00,390 --> 00:18:02,200
好了 为我祈祷吧
Okay, pray for me.

519
00:18:05,010 --> 00:18:06,930
好了 你到家了
Well, there you are.

520
00:18:06,930 --> 00:18:08,740
虽然并未如我们所愿
Didn't quite work out like we planned,

521
00:18:08,740 --> 00:18:11,040
但我还是用订书机钉了他的头
but I did get that staple in his head.

522
00:18:11,040 --> 00:18:12,850
你必须明白我之前的想法是出于正确的理由
You have to understand I did it for the right reasons.

523
00:18:12,850 --> 00:18:14,730
我 我本只是为了我的家人
I was -- I was just looking out for my family,

524
00:18:14,730 --> 00:18:17,060
但是 你也是我的家人
but... you're my family, too.

525
00:18:17,060 --> 00:18:19,440
你知道今晚最棒的一点是什么吗
You know what the best part of tonight was?

526
00:18:19,470 --> 00:18:21,620
并非是我一个人与厄尔对抗
It wasn't just me against Earl.

527
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:23,670
是我们一起对付他
It was us against him.

528
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:24,320
我喜欢这样
I liked that.

529
00:18:24,320 --> 00:18:26,110
我也喜欢 真的
I did too. Yeah.

530
00:18:26,110 --> 00:18:29,760
不过我保证 我以后再也不会站在别人那边了
And I promise I will never side with anyone else ever again.

531
00:18:30,730 --> 00:18:31,570
当然了 除非你是错的
Unless, of course, you're wrong,

532
00:18:31,570 --> 00:18:32,850
我还是要坚持我的基本原则
'cause I still do have my principles.

533
00:18:32,850 --> 00:18:34,200
好吧
Okay.

534
00:18:34,520 --> 00:18:35,560
下车吧
Just get out of the car.

535
00:18:35,560 --> 00:18:39,390
走之前我得给你这个
First I have to give you this.

536
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:40,640
是我那个名片盒
It's my old rolodex!

537
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:42,300
没错 我从他办公室偷出来的
Yeah. I stole it out of his office.

538
00:18:42,300 --> 00:18:43,760
怎么可能 什么时候偷的
But how? When?

539
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:45,960
你们俩在那张办公桌上扭打了大约十分钟吧
You guys were rolling around under that desk for about 10 minutes.

540
00:18:45,970 --> 00:18:48,390
我拿走以后 还有时间回复邮件呢
After I grabbed it, I had time to return some e-mails.

541
00:18:48,390 --> 00:18:49,820
谢谢你
Thank you for this.

542
00:18:50,910 --> 00:18:52,330
它很有意义[二弟]
It's a huge deal.

543
00:18:53,030 --> 00:18:55,370
对我而言这个词已经被污染了
That word's kind of tainted for me now, so...

544
00:18:57,190 --> 00:18:58,430
你们冷吗 我可以把温度调高点
You guys cold? I can turn up the heat,

545
00:18:58,430 --> 00:19:00,220
你们就用不着披毯子了
get you out from underneath that blanket.

546
00:19:00,220 --> 00:19:02,250
不用了 菲邓[洛杉矶警局]
We're good, L.A.P.D.

547
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:06,180
尽管我很想把迪兰赶出去 但我是不会退缩的
As bad as I wanted Dylan out, I wasn't gonna flinch.

548
00:19:06,180 --> 00:19:07,310
这事必须由菲尔来做
Phil needed to do it.

549
00:19:07,310 --> 00:19:10,430
他必须得跟网上那只鹰一样强硬
He needed to be as tough as that eagle on the internet.

550
00:19:10,670 --> 00:19:12,810
那只愚蠢的水獭完全没料到它的突袭
Dumb otter never saw it coming.

551
00:19:13,330 --> 00:19:15,800
打住啦 好痒啊
Oh, stop! That tickles!

552
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:17,110
你还好吗 菲尔
You all right, Phil?

553
00:19:17,110 --> 00:19:18,340
好得很 正享受电影呢
Yeah, just enjoying the movie.

554
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:20,340
你喜欢这片吗 根本不恐怖啊
Oh, you are? It's not even scary.

555
00:19:20,340 --> 00:19:22,860
那是我见过的最傻的海怪了
Like, that is the lamest sea monster I've ever seen.

556
00:19:22,860 --> 00:19:24,610
那是因为你能看得到
That's 'cause you can see it.

557
00:19:24,610 --> 00:19:27,360
如果你能想象表面[毯子]之下
It is way scarier if you can only imagine

558
00:19:27,360 --> 00:19:29,850
发生着些什么 那就可怕多了
what's going on beneath the surface.

559
00:19:30,550 --> 00:19:32,160
够了 我受够了
That's it! I'm done!

560
00:19:32,700 --> 00:19:33,580
海莉 迪兰
Haley, Dylan,

561
00:19:33,580 --> 00:19:34,990
你们这个同居小方案
this little living arrangement of yours,

562
00:19:34,990 --> 00:19:37,240
是行不通的 必须改改了
It's not working out and it's about to change.

563
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:38,610
老爸 你急个什么劲儿啊
Dad, why are you freaking out?

564
00:19:38,610 --> 00:19:39,760
因为我是你父亲
Because I'm your father

565
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:40,670
我无法容忍你们俩
and I can't have the two of you

566
00:19:40,670 --> 00:19:43,790
睡在一个屋子里 却假装这没什么大不了的
sleeping together in the same room like it's no big deal.

567
00:19:43,890 --> 00:19:44,540
所以 从现在起
So, from now on,

568
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:46,590
你们必须对我表现出应有的尊重
you're gonna show me the respect I deserve

569
00:19:46,590 --> 00:19:48,340
背着我偷偷摸摸地干这些事
and sneak around behind my back.

570
00:19:48,340 --> 00:19:49,040
干什么事
Do what, now?

571
00:19:49,040 --> 00:19:50,280
我不明白
I don't understand.

572
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:52,070
从今晚开始 你睡艾丽克斯的屋子里
Starting tonight, you're sleeping in Alex's room,

573
00:19:52,070 --> 00:19:53,770
如果你们要耍什么花招
And if there's any monkey business,

574
00:19:53,770 --> 00:19:55,210
最好趁我睡着了以后再搞
better happen after I'm asleep.

575
00:19:55,220 --> 00:19:56,630
你开什么玩笑啊
Are you serious?!

576
00:19:56,630 --> 00:19:58,280
-我可以接受 -我也是
- I'm okay with that. - Me too.

577
00:19:58,280 --> 00:19:59,610
我不能接受
I'm not okay with that.

578
00:19:59,910 --> 00:20:01,560
我任何一点都不能接受
I'm not okay with any of that.

579
00:20:01,560 --> 00:20:04,360
海莉 你必须把重点放在工作上
Haley, you need to start focusing on your job.

580
00:20:04,360 --> 00:20:06,080
迪兰 你明天就得搬出去
Dylan, you're moving out tomorrow.

581
00:20:22,060 --> 00:20:22,700
到此为止
End of discussion!

582
00:20:23,740 --> 00:20:26,300
抱歉 我不是酷妈
Sorry. I'm not the cool mom.

583
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:27,380
绝不是酷妈
Not the cool mom.

584
00:20:28,320 --> 00:20:29,540
孩子们 我尽力了
Hey, guys, I tried.

585
00:20:32,780 --> 00:20:33,440
谢了
Thanks.

586
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,430
你跑我床上来干什么
What are you doing in my bed?!

587
00:20:43,430 --> 00:20:44,920
等着你爸睡着啊
Waiting for your dad to fall asleep.

588
00:20:44,930 --> 00:20:47,230
怎么回事啊
What is going on in here?!

589
00:20:47,230 --> 00:20:49,270
艾丽克斯 你怎么回来了
Alex, why are you home?

590
00:20:49,760 --> 00:20:51,790
桑杰跟我分手了
Sanjay broke up with me.

591
00:20:53,450 --> 00:20:54,260
小宝贝
Sweetheart.

592
00:20:54,270 --> 00:20:55,180
一切都会好起来的
Everything will be fine.

593
00:20:55,180 --> 00:20:57,520
滚去跟海莉睡吧
Just go sleep with Hayley.
